2. Type modifiers

	short int

	    Short integer type.

	long int

	    Long integer type.

	long long int

    	at least as wide as an long int, and at least 64 bits.

	signed int / signed char

	    Can represent negative and nonnegative values

	unsigned int / unsinged char

	    Represents only nonnegative values

	long doubble

	    Extend floating-point type, with implementation-dependent precision
